WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
So be it

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,880
My house has been a mess these days

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,520
I need someone to help me clean it up.

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,160
I can hire my sister-in-law as a nanny

5
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,480
Every day from 8 am to 8 pm

6
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,400
Come to my house to work

7
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,710
Specially serve my food and daily life

8
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,920
Salary?

9
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,340
I take care of three meals a day for my sister-in-law

10
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,700
And he and his sister-in-law are allowed to bring a piece of bread every day

11
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:23,920
How about going home with a bottle of mineral water Lin Dong

12
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,470
too much

13
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,500
Why should I clean up your house?

14
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,180
You look down on people too much, right?

15
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,300
I'm a talented student

16
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,340
Or the atmosphere of a monthly salary of 50,000 yuan

17
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,420
Lin Dong, a social elite

18
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,300
This is definitely not possible. Do you think this will work?

19
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,820
Your sister-in-law and I will help you clean up the house

20
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,740
I will definitely clean it up for you

21
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,220
Men are not welcome in my home

22
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:49,800
If you are not happy, forget it Wang Sheng

23
00:00:50,200 --> 00:01:29,180
It's weird for us that you left me and ran away.

24
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:31,380
Why do I smell the aroma of hot pot?

25
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:32,500
Is it an illusion?

26
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:34,020
It really tastes like hot pot

27
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:45,780
Came from Lin Dong’s room

28
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:52,470
Just go work for Lin Dong
